# Terminology glossary for French — hand-authored, no POT.
#
# Read by translation-block-qa: msgstr pins the expected French form (absent
# from a translation -> fail); an identity msgstr must survive verbatim.
# French forms follow WHO's own French terminology where it exists (WHO GDHCN,
# IHR (2005) French text). Unofficial: agent-authored, no human sign-off.
